{"v":4,"catch":"讓奇蹟發生，“Libble 和 Rabble”。","desc":"《LIBBLE RABBLE》是NAMCO於1983年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制 Libble 和 Rabble 到 bashishi 各種角色。\n當你將所有從寶箱中彈出的Topcups 擊碎時，就會出現奇蹟，讓你進入獎勵階段。\n記住寶箱位置並爭取高分。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-11-11","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/792683d5f2dfac2e8c8a873026601dec54e56072877929ce3f94935f384da765.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2eeb72673b07595162c8fcc492e4e00d3ee3d5730c6a8cd26e8bfc97701588e9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0bf6220cb5bde7fa81c0909bda41c2222ad29b243f7e494597a9e924de7ad0c4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b7efb0bd9dbe791b8943a4b4947821be15aacee070b7d95f528000cc3539919.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c1e9add44cfd5b5120c88f2f9fc8d6658ec1557db5c4a7291d63d8b2d86355e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/73f55273e884c338335ee039d5f1a2d5faa944ef757e97b61d89613e4a2f7f02.jpg"],"titleId":"0100cb7015ac4000","dlc":[]}